# English only

This repository (**ms-poc**) is **English-only**.

## Applies to

- All documentation (`docs/`, `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, ADRs, comments in markdown)
- UI copy, labels, error messages, demo data narratives
- Code comments (unless quoting external APIs)
- Commit messages (Conventional Commits, English — already required)
- Agent responses about this project in chat may stay in the user's language, but **files committed to the repo must be English**

## Does not apply to

- User chat language preference outside the repo
- Third-party skill files under `.agents/skills/` (upstream English)

## When editing

If you find Portuguese (or any non-English) in repo docs or UI strings, translate to English in the same change.
